  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integral Ecology in the Amazon - transition phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a this transitory project following an 9,5 year process, with 3 project cycles which led to the development of a Plan to Protect the Amazon developed by the local communities among others. An external evaluation carried out in 2023 gave some useful insight of future directions. 
The main objective is to continue strengthening the communities in the care and defence of the Amazon in order to have a renewed idea of human relations and with nature, as well as to delegate responsibility to the communities themselves for the processes that are accompanied in their communities so that they acquire more autonomy, generate spaces for reflection on the learning acquired, listen to new voices and innovations for the design of a new project proposal that contributes to the conservation and defence of the Amazon - our Common Home</narrative>
  </description>
